  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/19834c919966288c99419a07884d09739eed61fb7b636905d29e78d8456bb0d3.png] \n\n \n \n\n **Letter**\n ×\n \n \n\n **Interchange with**\n ÷\n \n \n\nAfter interchanging the signs, the equation we get,\n\nI. 5 + 6 × 2 - 4 ÷ 1 = 10\n\n→ 5 + **6 ****÷**** 2** - 4 × 1 = 10\n\n→ 5 + 3 - **4 ****×**** 1** = 10\n\n→ **5 + 3** - 4 = 10\n\n→ 8 - 4 = 10\n\n→ 4 ≠ 10\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nII. 9 × 3 - 4 ÷ 2 + 5 = 4\n\n→ **9 ****÷ 3** - 4 × 2 + 5 = 4\n\n→ 3 - **4 ****×**** 2** + 5 = 4\n\n→ **3** - 8 **+ 5** = 4\n\n→ 8 - 8 = 4\n\n→ 0 ≠ 4\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
